attribution: Words by Charles Wesley (1739; he died in 1788) as altered by George Whitefield (1753; he died in 1770), sung to a melody from Felix Mendelssohn's Festgesang (1840; he died in 1847) adapted by William H. Cummings in 1855 (he died in 1915). Melody and words are public domain worldwide.
