melody:
Hark! the her-ald an-gels sing,
C4 F4 F4. E4/ F4 A4 A4 ~G4
Glo-ry to the new-born King;
C5 C5 C5. Bb4/ A4 G4 A4(2)
peace on earth, and mer-cy mild,
C4 F4 F4. E4/ F4 A4 A4 ~G4
God and sin-ners rec-on-ciled!
C5 G4 G4. E4/ E4 D4 C4(2)
Joy-ful, all ye na-tions, rise,
C5 C5 C5 F4 Bb4 A4 A4 ~G4
join the tri-umph of the skies;
C5 C5 C5 F4 Bb4 A4 A4 ~G4
with th'an-gel-ic host pro-claim,
D5 D5 D5 C5 Bb4 A4 Bb4(2)
Christ is born in Beth-le-hem!
G4 A4/ ~Bb4/ C5. F4/ F4 G4 A4(2)
Hark! the her-ald an-gels sing,
D5. D5/ D5 C5 Bb4 A4 Bb4(2)
Glo-ry to the new-born King!
